# JustDubit Interface & Model Acquisition

This plan outlines the creation of a premium web interface for the video dubbing pipeline and the process for downloading the necessary multi-gigabyte model weights.

## User Review Required

> [!IMPORTANT]
> **100% Offline Processing**: Once the models are downloaded, all processing (video analysis, translation, and dubbing) will occur entirely on your local GPU. No data will be sent to the internet.
>
> **Local Translation**: JustDubit uses the local Gemma model to encode prompts. To translate from non-English to English, the interface will provide options to generate the appropriate prompt.
>
> **Language Detection**: JustDubit is an audio-visual generation model. It doesn't "autodetect" the source language for translation automatically; instead, it generates the target language based on the prompt provided. I will implement a local Whisper-based detection or a simple language selector to assist with this.

> [!WARNING]
> **Large Download Required**: The total size of the model weights is approximately **40GB**. Please ensure you have sufficient disk space and a stable internet connection before I begin the download.

## Proposed Changes

### Web Interface (FastAPI + React)
- **Backend (Python)**:
  - Create a FastAPI server ([server.py](file:///c:/just-dub-it/server.py)) to handle file uploads and trigger the inference pipeline.
  - Implement local Whisper integration for optional automated transcript generation from source video.
  - Implement a websocket or polling mechanism to provide real-time status updates from the pipeline.
- **Frontend (React/Vite)**:
  - Design a "WOW" factor interface with:
    - Glassmorphism effect for the main container.
    - Drag-and-drop zone with smooth animations.
    - **Language Selectors**: Explicit choice for source and target languages.
    - Interactive sliders and inputs for prompt, resolution, and seed.
    - Live progress bar and status console.
    - Video preview for both source and dubbed output.

### Model Download Script
- Create a [scripts/download_weights.py](file:///c:/just-dub-it/scripts/download_weights.py) using `huggingface_hub` to download all required components into a [weights/](file:///c:/just-dub-it/scripts/download_weights.py#4-50) directory.
- Implement progress tracking for the massive downloads.

## Verification Plan

