- Verify FastAPI endpoints with `pytest` or simple health checks.
- Verify `huggingface-cli` connectivity.

### Manual Verification
- Test the drag-and-drop functionality with a small sample video.
- Verify that inference can be triggered and status is reported back to the UI.
